# target: only the local part of the change (per-pair tone curve and everything coarser than ~8 px removed). input: video luma + 0.7-1.4 levels of white noise, 8 bit, dither removal.
# loss l1 + gradient l1. 8 convs 3x3, 24 features, relu, 31705 weights, 10291 steps, ema weights.
